<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:v="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml" xmlns:o="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
    <meta name="color-scheme" content="light only">
    <meta name="supported-color-schemes" content="light only">
    <title><%= subject %></title>
    <!--[if mso]>
    <style>* { font-family: Arial, sans-serif !important; }</style>
    <![endif]-->
    <style>
        body, table, td, a { -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; }
        table, td { mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; }
        img { -ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic; border: 0; outline: none; text-decoration: none; }
        body { margin: 0; padding: 0; width: 100% !important; background-color: #f1eefb; }
        a { color: #6d28d9; }
        @media only screen and (max-width: 600px) {
            .email-card { width: 100% !important; border-radius: 0 !important; }
            .px { padding-left: 24px !important; padding-right: 24px !important; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body style="margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f1eefb;">

    <!-- Preheader (hidden preview text) -->
    <div style="display:none; max-height:0; overflow:hidden; opacity:0; mso-hide:all;">
        Votre compte AfroHK est prêt. Activez-le et changez votre mot de passe dès la première connexion.
    </div>

    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color:#f1eefb;">
        <tr>
            <td align="center" style="padding: 32px 16px;">

                <table role="presentation" class="email-card" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:600px; max-width:600px; background-color:#ffffff; border-radius:16px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 6px 24px rgba(76,29,149,0.10);">

                    <!-- Header -->
                    <tr>
                        <td align="center" bgcolor="#5b21b6" style="background-color:#5b21b6; background-image:linear-gradient(135deg,#6d28d9 0%,#4c1d95 100%); padding: 36px 24px;">
                            <div style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:2px; text-transform:uppercase; color:#d6c8f7; font-weight:bold;">Afro House of Knowledge</div>
                            <div style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:26px; line-height:32px; color:#ffffff; font-weight:bold; margin-top:8px;">✨ Bienvenue sur AfroHK</div>
                        </td>
                    </tr>

                    <!-- Body -->
                    <tr>
                        <td class="px" style="padding: 36px 40px 8px 40px; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color:#374151; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6;">
                            <h1 style="margin:0 0 16px 0; font-size:22px; line-height:28px; color:#4c1d95;">Bonjour <%= user.name %> <%= user.surname %> 👋</h1>
                            <p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;">Votre compte a été créé avec succès sur <strong>Afro House of Knowledge</strong>. Voici vos identifiants de connexion&nbsp;:</p>
                        </td>
                    </tr>

                    <!-- Credentials card -->
                    <tr>
                        <td class="px" style="padding: 16px 40px 8px 40px;">
                            <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color:#f6f2fe; border-radius:12px;">
                                <tr>
                                    <td style="padding: 22px 24px; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:15px; line-height:1.6; color:#374151; border-left:4px solid #6d28d9; border-radius:12px;">
                                        <p style="margin:0 0 10px 0;"><span style="color:#6d28d9; font-weight:bold;">Nom d'utilisateur&nbsp;:</span> <%= user.username %></p>
                                        <p style="margin:0;"><span style="color:#6d28d9; font-weight:bold;">Mot de passe&nbsp;:</span> <span style="font-family:'Courier New',monospace; background-color:#ede5fc; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:4px;"><%= password %></span></p>
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                            </table>
                        </td>
                    </tr>

                    <!-- Security note -->
                    <tr>
                        <td class="px" style="padding: 16px 40px 4px 40px;">
                            <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color:#fff8e6; border-radius:10px;">
                                <tr>
                                    <td style="padding: 14px 18px; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5; color:#92600a;">
                                        <strong>⚠️ Important&nbsp;:</strong> pour votre sécurité, changez votre mot de passe dès votre première connexion.
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                            </table>
                        </td>
                    </tr>

                    <!-- Bulletproof button -->
                    <tr>
                        <td align="center" style="padding: 24px 40px 8px 40px;">
                            <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" align="center">
                                <tr>
                                    <td align="center" bgcolor="#6d28d9" style="border-radius:10px;">
                                        <a href="<%= url %>" target="_blank" style="display:inline-block; padding:15px 38px; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:16px; font-weight:bold; color:#ffffff; text-decoration:none; border-radius:10px; background-color:#6d28d9;">Activer mon compte&nbsp;&rarr;</a>
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                            </table>
                        </td>
                    </tr>

                    <!-- Secondary -->
                    <tr>
                        <td class="px" style="padding: 12px 40px 36px 40px; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color:#6b7280; font-size:14px; line-height:1.6;">
                            <p style="margin:0 0 6px 0;">Le bouton ne fonctionne pas ? Copiez ce lien dans votre navigateur&nbsp;:<br>
                                <a href="<%= url %>" style="color:#6d28d9; word-break:break-all;"><%= url %></a></p>
                            <p style="margin:16px 0 0 0;">Si vous n'avez pas demandé la création de ce compte, ignorez cet email ou contactez-nous immédiatement.</p>
                            <p style="margin:16px 0 0 0; color:#374151;">Cordialement,<br><strong>L'équipe AfroHK</strong></p>
                        </td>
                    </tr>

                    <!-- Footer -->
                    <tr>
                        <td align="center" bgcolor="#faf8ff" style="background-color:#faf8ff; padding: 24px 40px; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color:#9ca3af; font-size:13px; line-height:1.6; border-top:1px solid #eee6fb;">
                            <p style="margin:0 0 6px 0; color:#6b7280; font-weight:bold;">Afro House of Knowledge — Le savoir sans barrières</p>
                            <p style="margin:0 0 10px 0;">
                                <a href="https://www.afrohk.com" style="color:#6d28d9; text-decoration:none;">www.afrohk.com</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp;&nbsp;
                                <a href="mailto:contact@afrohk.com" style="color:#6d28d9; text-decoration:none;">contact@afrohk.com</a>
                            </p>
                            <p style="margin:0; font-size:12px; color:#b9bcc4;">Cet email a été envoyé automatiquement. Merci de ne pas y répondre directement.</p>
                        </td>
                    </tr>

                </table>

            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>

</body>
</html>
